block-6\",\"id\":\"section-4\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":83,\"title\":\"管理鉴权\"}],\"segment\":{\"block_ids\":[\"block-1\",\"block-2\",\"block-3\",\"block-4\",\"block-5\",\"block-6\",\"block-7\"],\"end_char\":126,\"id\":\"parse:5086c302-1ad0-45c9-bd07-cb31482b12f6:0:126\",\"read_end_char\":126,\"read_start_char\":0,\"section_ids\":[\"section-1\",\"section-2\",\"section-3\",\"section-4\"],\"source_id\":\"parse:5086c302-1ad0-45c9-bd07-cb31482b12f6\",\"split_block_ids\":[],\"start_char\":0,\"text_sha256\":\"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792\"},\"source\":{\"asset_id\":\"fdf58653-e45b-4618-8d14-f2d819c5ad5c\",\"document_id\":\"f047293d-9b4c-55fd-8964-03af80aff76f\",\"id\":\"parse:5086c302-1ad0-45c9-bd07-cb31482b12f6\",\"length_chars\":126,\"original_sha256\":\"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792\",\"roles\":[\"old\",\"original:f047293d-9b4c-55fd-8964-03af80aff76f:62d2c866-1a15-4620-80a5-c4fb140d99a0:fdf58653-e45b-4618-8d14-f2d819c5ad5c:5086c302-1ad0-45c9-bd07-cb31482b12f6\"],\"snapshot_id\":\"5086c302-1ad0-45c9-bd07-cb31482b12f6\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"text_sha256\":\"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792\",\"version_id\":\"62d2c866-1a15-4620-80a5-c4fb140d99a0\",\"warnings\":[]},\"start_char\":0,\"tables\":[],\"text\":\"# 订单服务需求\\r\\n\\r\\n## 订单保留\\r\\n已支付订单保留7天，超过保留期查询返回410。\\r\\n\\r\\n## 优惠码\\r\\n提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\\r\\n\\r\\n## 管理鉴权\\r\\n未登录访问GET /admin必须返回401，不得创建登录前置。\\r\\n\"}],\"analysis_protocol\":{\"instruction\":\"Return one impact-response-v2 JSON object using this response_schema. The saved call owns the current unit; do not output a unit, UUID or hash. Use only short references in fixed_references: S for sources, P for segments, C for cases, D for differences. For action=read supply short references/ranges with no final outcome or candidates; for finish supply unit_outcome/candidates/unresolved with no pending reads. Discovery candidates cite exact supplied original slices; positions are original character offsets, not normalized diff offsets. Case citations use literal JSON paths and actual values from a complete case supplied in this message history. Catalogs are not read evidence. During coordination stage case_impacts, candidates are BoundRuleCaseAssessment objects with rule_ref R1 etc. and case_impacts; assess every fixed rule for the current complete case. The server preserves the fixed rule body and binds identities/hashes before fact checks. Canonical identities mentioned in coordination instructions are internal; this response_schema defines the model reply. Do not rewrite those identities or copy hashes. Request fixed reads for cross-section/missing evidence. Keep intentional negative conditions. Applicability is a suggestion, deployment unknown, all candidates pending review. Do not claim full project coverage or execute/change official records.\",\"response_schema\":{\"$defs\":{\"BoundCaseCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Case Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"none\",\"minor\",\"major\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Level\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"verification_points\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Verification Points\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"case_ref\",\"level\",\"reason\",\"citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundCaseCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"integer\"}]},\"title\":\"Path\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"root\":{\"default\":\"content_json\",\"enum\":[\"content_json\",\"execution_notes\"],\"title\":\"Root\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"title\":\"Value\"}},\"required\":[\"value\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRangeRead\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\"],\"title\":\"BoundRangeRead\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundReadRequest\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Case Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"difference_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^D[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Difference Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"ranges\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRangeRead\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Ranges\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"segment_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^P[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Segment Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"title\":\"BoundReadRequest\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"applicability_suggestion\":{\"default\":\"unknown\",\"enum\":[\"unknown\",\"current\",\"future\"],\"title\":\"Applicability Suggestion\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"document_citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundTextCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Document Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"key\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Key\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"added\",\"modified\",\"removed\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"uncertainties\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Uncertainties\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"key\",\"kind\",\"summary\",\"reason\",\"document_citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"rule_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^R[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Rule Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"rule_ref\",\"case_impacts\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundTextCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"quote\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Quote\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\",\"quote\"],\"title\":\"BoundTextCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"read\",\"finish\"],\"title\":\"Action\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"candidates\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCandidate\"},{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCaseAssessment\"}]},\"title\":\"Candidates\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"protocol_version\":{\"const\":\"impact-response-v2\",\"title\":\"Protocol Version\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reads\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundReadRequest\"},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unit_outcome\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"enum\":[\"analyzed\",\"evidence_insufficient\"],\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"default\":null,\"title\":\"Unit Outcome\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Unresolved\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"protocol_version\",\"action\",\"summary\"],\"title\":\"DocumentImpactBoundDecision\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"scope\":\"one declared unit only\",\"sha256\":\"1153d64ff0fffe0b510e148334e31b5361880c660d67c695b957a57f3bc91e42\",\"version\":\"impact-call-v4\"},\"coordination_context\":{\"discovery_units\":[],\"protocol\":{\"case_instruction\":\"本阶段将rules中完整规则候选与当前完整固定用例及其编写来源比较。逐条返回candidate，key必须为对应rules.id，保留该规则的kind/summary及原文依据，case_impacts仅判断当前unit.id，每条说明none/minor/major/uncertain并引用当前用例实际字段。需要原文或来源时read补读。不得遗漏规则后声明analyzed；无法判断保留evidence_insufficient。discovery_units包含未完成范围时不能宣称完整或无变化。没有规则仍判断本用例来源是否充分。所有候选仍待评审，不能将模型建议当作部署事实或测试通过。\",\"discovery_instruction\":\"本阶段从固定原文及差异提出规则变化候选。只处理当前单元，可read补读。候选引用实际读取的原文；不是需求评审。依据不足保留evidence_insufficient和unresolved。\",\"sha256\":\"76f3c582a070c4b136e1e629ecdea508f0f1fe814e4a8dbd917180ca9051f5b5\",\"version\":\"impact-coordinator-v1\"},\"rules\":[],\"stage\":\"discover_rules\"},\"environment\":{\"deployment_status\":\"unknown\",\"environment_key\":\"声明环境\",\"provenance\":\"user_declared\",\"target_release\":\"尚无部署证据\"},\"fixed_case_catalog\":[{\"case_id\":\"5edf721b-b8d5-4d27-9ecb-704e337eb651\",\"content_hash\":\"42596fa49fab3fd77c2dfc5683f8af9c19b6b7c0e50352f5f182f178dd1dcd79\",\"version_id\":\"7980db39-8f8b-4480-b799-7ec53143e8a4\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"ee5383ae922029caabd5b4b216e53db97191c3d79d2b4d1bf0c9bfe5dc478556\"},{\"case_id\":\"6f1ba99d-f67e-415e-adff-a1587db591aa\",\"content_hash\":\"384189928f0e462b6a07ed651573d09e0ed1f2b13456ff0300e27541d491e038\",\"version_id\":\"e402d07c-3f15-4039-b99f-adbcf1c573c7\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"9aac5f688abc3fd092b1f26d1e8ae01044c98da06eeb5e1cbaa1933b15d5e7b0\"},{\"case_id\":\"946a8a1a-9529-43db-ad3d-32feffbe5026\",\"content_hash\":\"44e3a193096d2aa5a5b022c2a4585ef063d5978cebc449ea37dd5ac28e5eb12b\",\"version_id\":\"838d0c58-c981-4e10-8fa9-d656cff4bf8b\",\"version_record_sha256\":\"c1e7ec228c88c98311b0dbee35fb9d78d53cc83c8e7aad6749b719b4f1c803b5\"}],\"fixed_difference_catalog\":[{\"id\":\"raw:0\",\"index\":0,\"kind\":\"raw\",\"sha256\":\